 <h3><u>Abbas mere sar ki qasam kha</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Abbas mere sar ki qasam kha</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>Abbas</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Ghar se chale jab behre safar, (sibte payambar) x2</p> <p>Kehne lagi abbas ki madar, (shere dilawar) x2</p> <p>Eik nasihat karti hu(n) me, (ay mere dilbar) x2</p> <p>Gham koi bhi shabbir ke ayega nahi paas, abbas</p> <p>Ujrega na zehra ka bhara ghar, abbas mere sar ki qasam kha</p> <p>(abbas mere sar ki qasam kha) x2 abbas</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>ay buzu-e shabbir wafadar qasam kha,</li>
    <p>ujrega nahi zehra ka gharbar qasam kha,</p>
    <p>rakh haath mere sar pe tu ik baar qasam kha, abbas, </p>
    <p>aaqa pe fida hoga tera sar</p>
    <p>(abbas mere sar ki qasam kha) x2 abbas</p>
    <li>jab tak tera shano pe rakha he ye tera sar,</li>
    <p>ayenge nahi khayma-e sarwar me sitaghar,</p>
    <p>gar aaye su-e khayma laeeno ka wo lashkar, abbas</p>
    <p>jaa(n) de ke bachana hai tujhe ghar</p>
    <p>(abbas mere sar ki qasam kha) x2 abbas</p>
    <li>ye bazu nigehbaan hai zainab ki rida ke,</li>
    <p>narghe ho agar charo taraf ehle jafa ke,</p>
    <p>tu rakhega shehzadi ko parde me chhupa ke, abbas</p>
    <p>jaegi na shehzadi ki chadar</p>
    <p>(abbas mere sar ki qasam kha) x2 abbas</p>
    <li>saqa hai tu saqayi pe jaa(n) apni lutana,</li>
    <p>pyasi ho agar aal-e-nabi paani pilana,</p>
    <p>din raat sakina ko kaleje se lagana, abbas </p>
    <p>roegi na shabbir ki dukhtar</p>
    <p>(abbas mere sar ki qasam kha) x2 abbas</p>
    <li>kar wada ke ye qafla hargiz na lutega,</li>
    <p>jis tarha chala ghar se ye waisa hi milenga,</p>
    <p>ye jhula bhi aur jhoolne wala bhi rahenga, abbas</p>
    <p>ajayenge ghar laut ke asghar</p>
    <p>(abbas mere sar ki qasam kha) x2 abbas</p>
    <li>doran-e-safar dhyan rahe ehle haram ka,</li>
    <p>har waqt unhe saya mile tere alam ka,</p>
    <p>ik pal bhi na sadat ko ehsas ho gham ka, abbas</p>
    <p>na dhup parhegi kabhi unpar</p>
    <p>(abbas mere sar ki qasam kha) x2 abbas</p>
    <li>ye baat mere laal tujhe bhi to khabar hai,</li>
    <p>tu fatema zehra ki duawo(n) ka samar hai,</p>
    <p>sarwar ho agar dhup me tu misle shajar hai, abbas</p>
    <p>khanjar na chalega shahe dee(n) par</p>
    <p>(abbas mere sar ki qasam kha) x2 abbas</p>
    <li>phir mazhar-o-irfan ye bola wo dilawar,</li>
   </ol> <p>ye jaan bhi qurban hai zehra ke pisar par,</p> <p>kyu(n) aap ye kehti hai meri madar-e-muztar, abbas</p> <p>lut jaye na zehra ka bhara ghar</p></font>
